provisation, supreme musicianship and iconic centrality to the history of jazz'.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:97545","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":2766215,"name":"The Blue Train"}],"groups":[{"active":true,"id":255386,"name":"The John Coltrane Quartet"},{"active":true,"id":260757,"name":"The Miles Davis Sextet"},{"active":false,"id":261339,"name":"The Thelonious Monk Quartet"},{"active":true,"id":262152,"name":"The Miles Davis Quintet"},{"active":true,"id":269589,"name":"Thelonious Monk Septet"},{"active":true,"id":284744,"name":"Dizzy Gillespie And His Orchestra"},{"active":true,"id":358566,"name":"Dizzy Gillespie Sextet"},{"active":false,"id":380510,"name":"The Red Garland Quintet"},{"active":false,"id":381505,"name":"Thelonious Monk Trio"},{"active":true,"id":446642,"name":"Earl Bostic And His Orchestra"},{"active":true,"id":543984,"name":"Art Blakey's Big Band"},{"active":true,"id":572067,"name":"Paul Chambers Sextet"},{"active":true,"id":634011,"name":"The John Coltrane Sextet"},{"active":true,"id":843805,"name":"Johnny Hodges And His Orchestra"},{"active":true,"id":940204,"name":"East Coast All-Stars"},{"active":false,"id":943319,"name":"Eric Dolphy Quintet"},{"active":true,"id":1120397,"name":"John Coltrane Quintet"},{"active":true,"id":1201626,"name":"The Prestige All Stars"},{"active":true,"id":1365167,"name":"John Coltrane Trio"},{"active":false,"id":1583463,"name":"Cecil Taylor Quintet"},{"active":true,"id":1774831,"name":"Gay Crosse & His Good Humor Six"},{"active":false,"id":1868577,"name":"George Russell Orchestra"},{"active":true,"id":2053527,"name":"The Ray Draper Quintet"},{"active":false,"id":2177008,"name":"The Mal Waldron Sextet"},{"active":false,"id":2441580,"name":"Elmo Hope Sextet"},{"active":true,"id":2612438,"name":"Oscar Pettiford & His All Stars"},{"active":true,"id":2703010,"name":"Gene Ammons' All Stars"},{"active":true,"id":2779859,"name":"Wilbur Harden-Tommy Flanagan Quintet"},{"active":true,"id":2779862,"name":"Wilbur H